(2053499, 282263, 32084, '<td valign="top">I have a nearly identical shot in my ''Signs'' possibilites.  Got the wife the flash you the sign like I did?  Wasn''t too hard as she hates modeling for me.  I didn;t submit it because it was way better after some major dodging and burning - now my desktop!  Insofar as the shot, I like it.  Maybe a little more shadwoed lighting on the hand to create interest and the shadow across the eye is a little distracting.  Good luck!</td>', 'I have a nearly identical shot in my ''Signs'' possibilites.  Got the wife the flash you the sign like I did?  Wasn''t too hard as she hates modeling for me.  I didn;t submit it because it was way better after some major dodging and burning - now my desktop!  Insofar as the shot, I like it.  Maybe a little more shadwoed lighting on the hand to create interest and the shadow across the eye is a little distracting.  Good luck!', '2006-01-18 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
