(2053652, 281373, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve noticed a difficulty with photographing signs. Even an otherwise good photo can be detracted from by having an irrelevant sign in it. You solve this problem by making the sign difficult to read. The viewer knows it''s a location sign, and that''s all he needs to know.</td>', 'I''ve noticed a difficulty with photographing signs. Even an otherwise good photo can be detracted from by having an irrelevant sign in it. You solve this problem by making the sign difficult to read. The viewer knows it''s a location sign, and that''s all he needs to know.', '2006-01-18 10:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
