(2055016, 282890, 27533, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think a different angle would be better. I would have tried it with a higher angle, with the no smoking sign at the top of the frame and the cigarrettes and the bottom of the toilet in the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think a different angle would be better. I would have tried it with a higher angle, with the no smoking sign at the top of the frame and the cigarrettes and the bottom of the toilet in the bottom of the frame.', '2006-01-18 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
