(2055107, 282380, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place, image needs a little more to match.  How about punching up the green as well?  Wishing for a sign in one of the gardens inside.</td>', 'Beautiful place, image needs a little more to match.  How about punching up the green as well?  Wishing for a sign in one of the gardens inside.', '2006-01-18 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055118, 282201, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and taillight trails.  Neon sign is blown out - try adjusting highlights if you have (a recent) PS.  Less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors and taillight trails.  Neon sign is blown out - try adjusting highlights if you have (a recent) PS.  Less central composition would be better.', '2006-01-18 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055157, 282051, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W choice. Better whites and crop for less out-of-focus foreground would be better.</td>', 'Nice B&W choice. Better whites and crop for less out-of-focus foreground would be better.', '2006-01-18 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055158, 282855, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing/composition and nice colors.  But significant background is blurry, more DOF would help a lot.</td>', 'Interesting framing/composition and nice colors.  But significant background is blurry, more DOF would help a lot.', '2006-01-18 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055170, 281270, 32854, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, that''s quite the sight there</td>', 'Oh boy, that''s quite the sight there', '2006-01-18 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055204, 282749, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting view, and nice focus and DOF.  Less central composition would be better, try some angle.</td>', 'Interesting view, and nice focus and DOF.  Less central composition would be better, try some angle.', '2006-01-18 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055229, 282704, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, arrangement, and sharp sign.  I think that more DOF would be better with less out-of-focus foreground.</td>', 'Nice colors, arrangement, and sharp sign.  I think that more DOF would be better with less out-of-focus foreground.', '2006-01-18 17:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055233, 281546, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice mountains and clouds.  Further away from sign would probably be better and still fit the challenge.</td>', 'Nice mountains and clouds.  Further away from sign would probably be better and still fit the challenge.', '2006-01-18 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055244, 282464, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, focus, and DOF.  Too bad sky is blown out and top half is hazy, better black (instead of medium blue-gray) levels and more contrast would help.  Also consider an additional element of a person/viewer so you can get away from such a straight-on composition.</td>', 'Nice idea, focus, and DOF.  Too bad sky is blown out and top half is hazy, better black (instead of medium blue-gray) levels and more contrast would help.  Also consider an additional element of a person/viewer so you can get away from such a straight-on composition.', '2006-01-18 17:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055245, 280672, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Would be nice if you could have caught focus for both sign and face with large aperture, but would have required subjects attention/cooperation to look over shoulder.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Would be nice if you could have caught focus for both sign and face with large aperture, but would have required subjects attention/cooperation to look over shoulder.', '2006-01-18 17:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055249, 282471, 44490, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  More in-focus woody and less-central hard edge line would be better.</td>', 'Cute idea.  More in-focus woody and less-central hard edge line would be better.', '2006-01-18 17:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055261, 281239, 44490, '<td valign="top">Looks overprocessed and blown out, but image is strong enough to work for me.  Nice colors and interesting composition.</td>', 'Looks overprocessed and blown out, but image is strong enough to work for me.  Nice colors and interesting composition.', '2006-01-18 17:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055278, 282966, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, interesting composition, and you caught the feeling.  More DOF for sharper, more in-focus hand would be better, but it still works - best of the hand signs.</td>', 'Nice colors, interesting composition, and you caught the feeling.  More DOF for sharper, more in-focus hand would be better, but it still works - best of the hand signs.', '2006-01-18 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055290, 280341, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, nice colors.  Probably would be better without the angle.</td>', 'Interesting building, nice colors.  Probably would be better without the angle.', '2006-01-18 17:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055305, 280802, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Overall image seems too yellow, whiter pen would be better, and desaturate for an older instead of yellower feeling.</td>', 'Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Overall image seems too yellow, whiter pen would be better, and desaturate for an older instead of yellower feeling.', '2006-01-18 17:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055324, 282977, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Sharp, bright background on left draws attention away from the main scene.  Would be better framed so person is more primary.</td>', 'Nice idea, and pretty good execution.  Sharp, bright background on left draws attention away from the main scene.  Would be better framed so person is more primary.', '2006-01-18 17:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
