(2055862, 280908, 25232, '<td valign="top">OK, I have been pretty lenient as far as DNMC up to this point, but I think this would have faired better in the Wildlife Challenge. <br/> <br/>DNMC<br/> <br/>BTW, that is a pretty good picture of a squirrel for what it''s worth.</td>', 'OK, I have been pretty lenient as far as DNMC up to this point, but I think this would have faired better in the Wildlife Challenge.  DNMC BTW, that is a pretty good picture of a squirrel for what it''s worth.', '2006-01-18 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055904, 282101, 25232, '<td valign="top">Now you are really pushing it. When I saw the Challenge description and it had nothing below it I said to myself "This is Great, no narrow interpretations for this challenge.  Then I go to judge them and it''s like everyone just took it as a <b>sign</b> to just post anything. Squirrels, busted casinos, girls in bathing suits... <br/> <br/>Interesting picture. <br/> <br/>I fail to see  how without the poetical title anyone could have derived <i>sign</i> from it though.</td>', 'Now you are really pushing it. When I saw the Challenge description and it had nothing below it I said to myself "This is Great, no narrow interpretations for this challenge.  Then I go to judge them and it''s like everyone just took it as a sign to just post anything. Squirrels, busted casinos, girls in bathing suits...  Interesting picture.  I fail to see  how without the poetical title anyone could have derived sign from it though.', '2006-01-18 19:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055942, 280885, 25232, '<td valign="top">I thought the sign of the crusades was a cross, thus C_R_U_S -A_D_E.<br/> <br/>I guess an oil pipeline could come to symbolize the modern greed that once again pushes self proclaimed Christians into foreign lands to plunder in the name of Righteousness.</td>', 'I thought the sign of the crusades was a cross, thus C_R_U_S -A_D_E. I guess an oil pipeline could come to symbolize the modern greed that once again pushes self proclaimed Christians into foreign lands to plunder in the name of Righteousness.', '2006-01-18 20:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2055950, 282891, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors in your image. For me, I would have scored this another point higher if the "APAR FAMILY" at the bottom had been completely cropped out. To me, my eyes would then read "Mo Sun" which works with the bright sky - just my thoughts. :-)</td>', 'I like the bright colors in your image. For me, I would have scored this another point higher if the "APAR FAMILY" at the bottom had been completely cropped out. To me, my eyes would then read "Mo Sun" which works with the bright sky - just my thoughts. :-)', '2006-01-18 20:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
