(2062281, 283011, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice touch (with that tear). Like the gloomy effect of b/w conversion. Lighting is good, and the composition is just right for this kind of a photo. That said this kind of a photo does not fare well in the challenges but at the same time it is refreshing to see this ''unforced'' form of art in any challenge.</td>', 'Nice touch (with that tear). Like the gloomy effect of b/w conversion. Lighting is good, and the composition is just right for this kind of a photo. That said this kind of a photo does not fare well in the challenges but at the same time it is refreshing to see this ''unforced'' form of art in any challenge.', '2006-01-20 00:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062285, 282510, 29269, '<td valign="top">Isn''t your ball going to roll to the right on this green? Or is it the tilted horizon:-) Since it looks like the trees in the background are growing crooked, I think that it is the photo after all.<br/>The crop should have been tighter IMO, to accentuate the sign (the flag). This way it is on par with an average snapshot. Hence the average score:5</td>', 'Isn''t your ball going to roll to the right on this green? Or is it the tilted horizon:-) Since it looks like the trees in the background are growing crooked, I think that it is the photo after all.The crop should have been tighter IMO, to accentuate the sign (the flag). This way it is on par with an average snapshot. Hence the average score:5', '2006-01-20 01:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
