(2062960, 282575, 48471, '<td valign="top">8 for the effort and the idea, but I don''t think it has achieved that level technically. I don''t like the light (maybe it has to do with the paint on the models, but I doubt it), the background is terrible and the pose is strange. I think it would be better if they were doing something to each other (looking, kissing, holding hands, whatever), rather than looking at me, and that from a high point of view.<br/>Kudos for out of the box approach and a beautiful pair of models.</td>', '8 for the effort and the idea, but I don''t think it has achieved that level technically. I don''t like the light (maybe it has to do with the paint on the models, but I doubt it), the background is terrible and the pose is strange. I think it would be better if they were doing something to each other (looking, kissing, holding hands, whatever), rather than looking at me, and that from a high point of view.Kudos for out of the box approach and a beautiful pair of models.', '2006-01-20 08:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
