(2064123, 281112, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good job finding the signs and presenting them together. I would have liked it in better focus.</td>', 'Good job finding the signs and presenting them together. I would have liked it in better focus.', '2006-01-20 13:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064136, 282752, 29148, '<td valign="top">Must be in KC?</td>', 'Must be in KC?', '2006-01-20 13:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064156, 281354, 29148, '<td valign="top">Very clean and effective composition.</td>', 'Very clean and effective composition.', '2006-01-20 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064199, 279917, 51210, '<td valign="top">I''d really love to see what filters you used for this picture.</td>', 'I''d really love to see what filters you used for this picture.', '2006-01-20 14:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064225, 282575, 34247, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is necessary, really, as a statement. In terms of the image itself, well...I think the lighting could be much improved, the posing and composition were awkwardly done, and the models'' expressions extremely unpleasing.</td>', 'I don''t think this is necessary, really, as a statement. In terms of the image itself, well...I think the lighting could be much improved, the posing and composition were awkwardly done, and the models'' expressions extremely unpleasing.', '2006-01-20 14:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064227, 282881, 51385, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2006-01-20 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064229, 281311, 51385, '<td valign="top">too dark on mine</td>', 'too dark on mine', '2006-01-20 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064234, 283011, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think this subject matter is always difficult to deal with, and it''s probably not going to be appealing in the context of this site. As an image, I find the lighting to be appropriate and quite well executed. There''s perhaps a slight overexposure onn the left hand. The shadow areas on the face works well to emphasize the mood that the image is trying to portray. I do think the crop on the top would be slightly lower as I do find the inclusion of the nails of the right hand to be a distraction.</td>', 'I think this subject matter is always difficult to deal with, and it''s probably not going to be appealing in the context of this site. As an image, I find the lighting to be appropriate and quite well executed. There''s perhaps a slight overexposure onn the left hand. The shadow areas on the face works well to emphasize the mood that the image is trying to portray. I do think the crop on the top would be slightly lower as I do find the inclusion of the nails of the right hand to be a distraction.', '2006-01-20 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064238, 283002, 34247, '<td valign="top">very small image size...and perhaps this could be fixed all too easily.</td>', 'very small image size...and perhaps this could be fixed all too easily.', '2006-01-20 14:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064242, 282891, 34247, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting images for me in this challenge. The partial signs seems to combine and convey a message. The bright bold colors are pleasing.</td>', 'One of the more interesting images for me in this challenge. The partial signs seems to combine and convey a message. The bright bold colors are pleasing.', '2006-01-20 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064251, 281270, 34247, '<td valign="top">I generally have very mixed feelings about anthropomorphism. I do find the composition here to be a bit on the bland side, and I''d reckon the inclusion of more of a background might have resulted in a more effective image. The colors seem a bit strange as well, with a bit of a hazyness to the hills in the background.</td>', 'I generally have very mixed feelings about anthropomorphism. I do find the composition here to be a bit on the bland side, and I''d reckon the inclusion of more of a background might have resulted in a more effective image. The colors seem a bit strange as well, with a bit of a hazyness to the hills in the background.', '2006-01-20 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064255, 280934, 34247, '<td valign="top">The high contrast here is an interesting choice, but I do feel the blinding quality of the ground is competing too much with the main subject of the image.</td>', 'The high contrast here is an interesting choice, but I do feel the blinding quality of the ground is competing too much with the main subject of the image.', '2006-01-20 14:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064261, 282308, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a funny idea, but I do think the execution could have been better. The use of flash, for instance, I think takes away from the image, and perhaps a daytime shot would have been more effective.</td>', 'It''s a funny idea, but I do think the execution could have been better. The use of flash, for instance, I think takes away from the image, and perhaps a daytime shot would have been more effective.', '2006-01-20 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064264, 282964, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice muted coloring goes well with the pictures.</td>', 'Nice muted coloring goes well with the pictures.', '2006-01-20 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064268, 279759, 34247, '<td valign="top">I suppose the use of a shallow dof on the sign alone might improve the impact of this image. As it is, the tangled branches compete very much for my attention.</td>', 'I suppose the use of a shallow dof on the sign alone might improve the impact of this image. As it is, the tangled branches compete very much for my attention.', '2006-01-20 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064269, 282380, 34247, '<td valign="top">The image feels flat, with a bit of hazyness and not enough contrast elements.</td>', 'The image feels flat, with a bit of hazyness and not enough contrast elements.', '2006-01-20 14:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064273, 280802, 34247, '<td valign="top">It won''t take too much to make a case that the declaration of independence was in fact more an economic rather than a political doctrine. The color toning here doesn''t gel for me, with the reddish tinge on the hand seeming very out of place. White balance corrections are in order perhaps...</td>', 'It won''t take too much to make a case that the declaration of independence was in fact more an economic rather than a political doctrine. The color toning here doesn''t gel for me, with the reddish tinge on the hand seeming very out of place. White balance corrections are in order perhaps...', '2006-01-20 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064275, 283010, 34247, '<td valign="top">Bright vibrant image, but I think the yellow bottom part does distract from the image. Maybe better as a red-dominated tone.</td>', 'Bright vibrant image, but I think the yellow bottom part does distract from the image. Maybe better as a red-dominated tone.', '2006-01-20 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064286, 280341, 34247, '<td valign="top">I find this composition to be a bit awkward, and I''m not sure if the sky inclusion adds value.</td>', 'I find this composition to be a bit awkward, and I''m not sure if the sky inclusion adds value.', '2006-01-20 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064294, 282858, 34247, '<td valign="top">Pleasing image, generally, but the titling is a bit odd and I don''t draw the connection. A simpler title would have added punch to the presentation. Contrast wise, i do think slightly more push would be very effective here. There''s a tuft of a tree on the left side of the frame that is distracting to me.</td>', 'Pleasing image, generally, but the titling is a bit odd and I don''t draw the connection. A simpler title would have added punch to the presentation. Contrast wise, i do think slightly more push would be very effective here. There''s a tuft of a tree on the left side of the frame that is distracting to me.', '2006-01-20 14:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064309, 282466, 42100, '<td valign="top">Funny photo.  Clever idea having the reflection with that sign.  Nice job!</td>', 'Funny photo.  Clever idea having the reflection with that sign.  Nice job!', '2006-01-20 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064442, 281490, 51731, '<td valign="top">very good.. in deed. love the motive. Beware in the middle of nowhere in this icy cold dark atomsphere. cool</td>', 'very good.. in deed. love the motive. Beware in the middle of nowhere in this icy cold dark atomsphere. cool', '2006-01-20 15:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064522, 281490, 51149, '<td valign="top">I like the way the traffic sign appears as the focal piont of the picture. <br/>I do also like the fence leading into the picture.<br/>But the backround (even if the backround is not the important thing for the challenge) is to me only a white wall of snow that seems to overrun me. <br/>It''s little boring, as well. <br/>But not bad - 6</td>', 'I like the way the traffic sign appears as the focal piont of the picture. I do also like the fence leading into the picture.But the backround (even if the backround is not the important thing for the challenge) is to me only a white wall of snow that seems to overrun me. It''s little boring, as well. But not bad - 6', '2006-01-20 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064548, 282682, 51149, '<td valign="top">I really like the structure of the picture. And like the way the stream leads into it. Nice composition - 9</td>', 'I really like the structure of the picture. And like the way the stream leads into it. Nice composition - 9', '2006-01-20 15:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064578, 283002, 44703, '<td valign="top">...or girl. :)</td>', '...or girl. :)', '2006-01-20 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064680, 283011, 12611, '<td valign="top">Sign of depression? more like solution. Very trite title; but the image is well exposed and contrasted. Perhaps this shot in a bathtub?</td>', 'Sign of depression? more like solution. Very trite title; but the image is well exposed and contrasted. Perhaps this shot in a bathtub?', '2006-01-20 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064684, 282769, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice; but really, this won''t be dynamic enough to hold the interest of most; a person in th eshot trying to get in might give some tension.</td>', 'Nice; but really, this won''t be dynamic enough to hold the interest of most; a person in th eshot trying to get in might give some tension.', '2006-01-20 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064689, 281239, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this with the jacked up saturation. Looks like a cannondale add. Winter sucks, doesn''t it? there just isn''t anything worth photographing.</td>', 'I like this with the jacked up saturation. Looks like a cannondale add. Winter sucks, doesn''t it? there just isn''t anything worth photographing.', '2006-01-20 16:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064694, 282998, 12611, '<td valign="top">Better title than photo. Just too much negative space for my taste/</td>', 'Better title than photo. Just too much negative space for my taste/', '2006-01-20 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2064919, 281117, 50982, '<td valign="top">Booooooo!</td>', 'Booooooo!', '2006-01-20 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
