(2065226, 282550, 40370, '<td valign="top">OUCH !! I have a dog with an orange nose too. I hope your mutt is okay.</td>', 'OUCH !! I have a dog with an orange nose too. I hope your mutt is okay.', '2006-01-20 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065263, 282466, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fantastic with the reflection of a ? church.</td>', 'Fantastic with the reflection of a ? church.', '2006-01-20 18:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065662, 282809, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a good sign.  I think it could be helped by having a more dynamic composition (rule of thirds) and a little levels adjustment as it appears to be a little underexposed.  Good Luck</td>', 'I think it''s a good sign.  I think it could be helped by having a more dynamic composition (rule of thirds) and a little levels adjustment as it appears to be a little underexposed.  Good Luck', '2006-01-20 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065666, 280494, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting old building and sign.  Good catch</td>', 'Interesting old building and sign.  Good catch', '2006-01-20 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065680, 281112, 18799, '<td valign="top">While this does meet the challenge, the composition just isn''t working for me.  I don''t know what to suggest for this either.  Maybe it''s just the subject matter that isn''t working or maybe a different angle.  As is, there isn''t anything to hold my interest and keep my eye moving through the image.  It''s just a picture of some signs.</td>', 'While this does meet the challenge, the composition just isn''t working for me.  I don''t know what to suggest for this either.  Maybe it''s just the subject matter that isn''t working or maybe a different angle.  As is, there isn''t anything to hold my interest and keep my eye moving through the image.  It''s just a picture of some signs.', '2006-01-20 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065681, 282897, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good catch of a humorous point of view.</td>', 'Good catch of a humorous point of view.', '2006-01-20 20:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065685, 282658, 18799, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, it''s a nice photo, but a stretch for this challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion, it''s a nice photo, but a stretch for this challenge.', '2006-01-20 20:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065687, 280685, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge  6</td>', 'Good take on the challenge  6', '2006-01-20 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065691, 283000, 18799, '<td valign="top">Not a lot going on here, just a sign.  Meets the challenge, but doesn''t have a lot of interest.  Sorry.</td>', 'Not a lot going on here, just a sign.  Meets the challenge, but doesn''t have a lot of interest.  Sorry.', '2006-01-20 20:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065692, 283002, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good interpetation of the challenge</td>', 'Good interpetation of the challenge', '2006-01-20 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065694, 282203, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting photograph and character, but it seems to me that the sign is incidental to the image.</td>', 'Interesting photograph and character, but it seems to me that the sign is incidental to the image.', '2006-01-20 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2065696, 282958, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good job.  8</td>', 'Nicely composed, good job.  8', '2006-01-20 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
