(2066139, 282704, 27533, '<td valign="top">Your title seems to indicate that you didn''t try very hard, so you might already see the flaws in this image, but I am trying to comment on anything that I scored really low. I am not sure what you are trying to show in this image, is the car crashing into the wall? The car is badly out of focus. I would have cropped it to inlude less of the "road" that the car is on. The "horizon" is crooked as well.</td>', 'Your title seems to indicate that you didn''t try very hard, so you might already see the flaws in this image, but I am trying to comment on anything that I scored really low. I am not sure what you are trying to show in this image, is the car crashing into the wall? The car is badly out of focus. I would have cropped it to inlude less of the "road" that the car is on. The "horizon" is crooked as well.', '2006-01-20 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066148, 279957, 27533, '<td valign="top">You really need to size your picture to the maximum size allowed, or it will not do well in any challenge. Also, the picture seems a little blurry.</td>', 'You really need to size your picture to the maximum size allowed, or it will not do well in any challenge. Also, the picture seems a little blurry.', '2006-01-20 22:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
