(2066474, 282740, 46468, '<td valign="top">The size of you photo is really too small to see any detail. You should try to have your picture as close to the largest allowed size as possible. Many voters score pics very low if they are smaller then they should be. Per site rules "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). <br/>Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels" Your dimensions are only 17,202 bytes and 213 x 183 pixels. Posting a larger photo on future challenges will greatly improve your score.</td>', 'The size of you photo is really too small to see any detail. You should try to have your picture as close to the largest allowed size as possible. Many voters score pics very low if they are smaller then they should be. Per site rules "File Size: No larger than 150 KB (153,600 bytes). Dimension: No dimension may be shorter than 160 pixels or longer than 640 pixels" Your dimensions are only 17,202 bytes and 213 x 183 pixels. Posting a larger photo on future challenges will greatly improve your score.', '2006-01-21 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066531, 282982, 46468, '<td valign="top">I really like the thought here, different slant on the challenge. However the low lighting and soft focus really hurts the image. It took me a few seconds to even see what else was there besides the clock. Not knowing what camera you have I can''t be sure if this is what happened, but quite a few cameras are unable to focus if you are too close to the item you are photographing. Most voters are very hard on out of focus images. Remember you had a very unique idea for the challenge and that is a big part of the overall package,  technical things you can learn, practice and improve much easier than trying to learn creativity which you already have.</td>', 'I really like the thought here, different slant on the challenge. However the low lighting and soft focus really hurts the image. It took me a few seconds to even see what else was there besides the clock. Not knowing what camera you have I can''t be sure if this is what happened, but quite a few cameras are unable to focus if you are too close to the item you are photographing. Most voters are very hard on out of focus images. Remember you had a very unique idea for the challenge and that is a big part of the overall package,  technical things you can learn, practice and improve much easier than trying to learn creativity which you already have.', '2006-01-21 00:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066543, 282522, 46468, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the sign and I like the surrounding scenery. However the rest of the photo is very dark; the trees appear so black that I can''t see the person on the bicyle''s head as it merges into the trees on the right. The darkness makes the image lose many details.</td>', 'Good focus on the sign and I like the surrounding scenery. However the rest of the photo is very dark; the trees appear so black that I can''t see the person on the bicyle''s head as it merges into the trees on the right. The darkness makes the image lose many details.', '2006-01-21 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
