(2066657, 282757, 15330, '<td valign="top">The sign is nice and clear (also contradicting), but I want to see something more. A sign with a plain white background is just not interesting enough. If the background is just a plain street with a few cars on it wait until the sky is more interesting than overcast. A sunset in the background would improve this a lot. But it is a funny photo I guess some people just don''t think about what they are doing when putting up these signs.</td>', 'The sign is nice and clear (also contradicting), but I want to see something more. A sign with a plain white background is just not interesting enough. If the background is just a plain street with a few cars on it wait until the sky is more interesting than overcast. A sunset in the background would improve this a lot. But it is a funny photo I guess some people just don''t think about what they are doing when putting up these signs.', '2006-01-21 02:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
