(2067749, 282495, 51767, '<td valign="top">A wonderful picture which I have difficulty determining why it is a 9, the closest I can come is that the image seems to strike an inconsistant note.  That is the problem with voting when the craft of some images are so superior.</td>', 'A wonderful picture which I have difficulty determining why it is a 9, the closest I can come is that the image seems to strike an inconsistant note.  That is the problem with voting when the craft of some images are so superior.', '2006-01-21 13:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067755, 282671, 51767, '<td valign="top">THere were a couple of images that I ranked higher because,, even though it was a stretch, I got it without looking at the title.  A wonderful picture, but it could just as easily fit into so many other catagories.</td>', 'THere were a couple of images that I ranked higher because,, even though it was a stretch, I got it without looking at the title.  A wonderful picture, but it could just as easily fit into so many other catagories.', '2006-01-21 13:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
