(2067807, 282584, 51767, '<td valign="top">An excellent picture, that left me concerned with both the image and title.  Maybe I just missed it, but the cross and lighthouse suggest salvation, but the colors and sky cause me to feel something quite different.  To much to be comfortable with "Signs."</td>', 'An excellent picture, that left me concerned with both the image and title.  Maybe I just missed it, but the cross and lighthouse suggest salvation, but the colors and sky cause me to feel something quite different.  To much to be comfortable with "Signs."', '2006-01-21 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067873, 282466, 45360, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea done well.  Would have been nice if the reflection wasn''t partly over the neon sign but I like this lots.  7.</td>', 'Lovely idea done well.  Would have been nice if the reflection wasn''t partly over the neon sign but I like this lots.  7.', '2006-01-21 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067888, 282363, 51767, '<td valign="top">An excellent photograph, but the white border detracts from the image as it hints at something missing.  I think it would have been much more powerful without the border - but I still easily got the sign without looking at the title.  Take a look at "Mark of Death " and then try looking at your image both ways with fresh eyes.</td>', 'An excellent photograph, but the white border detracts from the image as it hints at something missing.  I think it would have been much more powerful without the border - but I still easily got the sign without looking at the title.  Take a look at "Mark of Death " and then try looking at your image both ways with fresh eyes.', '2006-01-21 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067911, 282562, 51767, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh ... the color ... the color!  Captured as if brushstrokes across the picture.  "Signs" may be a stretch.  I would not have used a border - brush stroke is set down then lifted - rather than the cropped feel.</td>', 'Ohhhh ... the color ... the color!  Captured as if brushstrokes across the picture.  "Signs" may be a stretch.  I would not have used a border - brush stroke is set down then lifted - rather than the cropped feel.', '2006-01-21 14:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067950, 282363, 18349, '<td valign="top">It''s not good form to link to your picture from the forums during voting.  I''m sure that will probably render you some criticism and some scores that don''t reflect the image itself.  That said, it''s a nice photo with lots of tonal range and great clarity.  The border doesn''t bother me at all, either.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s not good form to link to your picture from the forums during voting.  I''m sure that will probably render you some criticism and some scores that don''t reflect the image itself.  That said, it''s a nice photo with lots of tonal range and great clarity.  The border doesn''t bother me at all, either.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-01-21 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2067965, 282363, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice! Well done... THE most creative I''ve seen so far in this challenge! I gave it a 10. I read your forum post in the forum... so I''ll answer you really quickly. <br/> <br/>The choice to add a border should be on whether it adds to the image. Some images don''t work well directly butted up against the neutral grey bg. Yours would have done well against the neutral grey, so the frame doesn''t add much for you. But, it certainly doesn''t detract from the image, other than you have lost that many pixels in which you could have shown just a little more detail. <br/> <br/>Hope that helps.</td>', 'Nice! Well done... THE most creative I''ve seen so far in this challenge! I gave it a 10. I read your forum post in the forum... so I''ll answer you really quickly.  The choice to add a border should be on whether it adds to the image. Some images don''t work well directly butted up against the neutral grey bg. Yours would have done well against the neutral grey, so the frame doesn''t add much for you. But, it certainly doesn''t detract from the image, other than you have lost that many pixels in which you could have shown just a little more detail.  Hope that helps.', '2006-01-21 14:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
