(2069623, 280931, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, Very powerful statement here too! Good sharp focus.</td>', 'Wow, Very powerful statement here too! Good sharp focus.', '2006-01-22 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069628, 282388, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and moon picture. Love the different colors here.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and moon picture. Love the different colors here.', '2006-01-22 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069633, 282873, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the idea and the stark blue of the sky really brings these two buildings out.</td>', 'Very nice, love the idea and the stark blue of the sky really brings these two buildings out.', '2006-01-22 00:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069635, 281354, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright, love the clarity. Good colors.</td>', 'Nice and bright, love the clarity. Good colors.', '2006-01-22 00:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069637, 279917, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Love the dark tones.</td>', 'Very nice, Love the dark tones.', '2006-01-22 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069638, 282884, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. Love the landscape and the dark clouds. Nicely done!</td>', 'Wonderful picture. Love the landscape and the dark clouds. Nicely done!', '2006-01-22 00:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069640, 281018, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic picture. Love how you captured the power in those waves, good focus.</td>', 'Wow, fantastic picture. Love how you captured the power in those waves, good focus.', '2006-01-22 00:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069642, 282658, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, Love the deep blue of the water, only suggestion I have is to place the tower a bit more off center. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, Love the deep blue of the water, only suggestion I have is to place the tower a bit more off center. Nicely done.', '2006-01-22 00:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069753, 280594, 44157, '<td valign="top">CUTIE!!</td>', 'CUTIE!!', '2006-01-22 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069828, 280025, 44611, '<td valign="top">A good interpretation of the theme with good composition and detail.</td>', 'A good interpretation of the theme with good composition and detail.', '2006-01-22 03:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069830, 281354, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting colours in this, and a interesting definition of the theme.</td>', 'Love the contrasting colours in this, and a interesting definition of the theme.', '2006-01-22 03:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069832, 281018, 44611, '<td valign="top">I like this, although I can imagine the literalists may be having a field day as it''s not a metal sign on a post!  This gives off energy and a message and I think is a great interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'I like this, although I can imagine the literalists may be having a field day as it''s not a metal sign on a post!  This gives off energy and a message and I think is a great interpretation of the theme.', '2006-01-22 03:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069833, 283010, 44611, '<td valign="top">Love the colour and wackiness of this.</td>', 'Love the colour and wackiness of this.', '2006-01-22 03:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069834, 283004, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, and I have a soft spot for the Treasury.</td>', 'Great perspective, and I have a soft spot for the Treasury.', '2006-01-22 03:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069836, 282884, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great landscape incorporating the theme.  Love that heavy, foreboding sky.</td>', 'Great landscape incorporating the theme.  Love that heavy, foreboding sky.', '2006-01-22 03:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069837, 281969, 44611, '<td valign="top">Simple and clear; good composition and colour.</td>', 'Simple and clear; good composition and colour.', '2006-01-22 03:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069838, 282363, 44611, '<td valign="top">Very evocative and emotional image.  Superbly done.</td>', 'Very evocative and emotional image.  Superbly done.', '2006-01-22 03:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069840, 282206, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lovely - well seen composition, perhaps a shame that there isn''t a little more colour amongst the flowers.</td>', 'Lovely - well seen composition, perhaps a shame that there isn''t a little more colour amongst the flowers.', '2006-01-22 03:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069841, 283003, 44611, '<td valign="top">Bold, clear, well composed.  The lighting seems a bit strange, but doesn''t distract too much.</td>', 'Bold, clear, well composed.  The lighting seems a bit strange, but doesn''t distract too much.', '2006-01-22 03:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069843, 281490, 44611, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this, although I imagine some people may not get it.  Great thinking.</td>', 'I really like the concept of this, although I imagine some people may not get it.  Great thinking.', '2006-01-22 03:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069846, 282779, 44611, '<td valign="top">My top pick - I love the antique-ey feel to this.  Well seen and composed.</td>', 'My top pick - I love the antique-ey feel to this.  Well seen and composed.', '2006-01-22 03:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069847, 282121, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well seen, good composition and interesting interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Well seen, good composition and interesting interpretation of the theme.', '2006-01-22 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069848, 282531, 44611, '<td valign="top">Super - I have no idea what it is though.  Good clarity and fits the theme.</td>', 'Super - I have no idea what it is though.  Good clarity and fits the theme.', '2006-01-22 03:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069850, 282308, 44611, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the tilted angle really adds much to this, but I''ve scored it based more on the humour as it did make me smile.</td>', 'Not sure that the tilted angle really adds much to this, but I''ve scored it based more on the humour as it did make me smile.', '2006-01-22 03:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069851, 282959, 44611, '<td valign="top">Nor me!  Interesting sign.</td>', 'Nor me!  Interesting sign.', '2006-01-22 03:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069852, 282125, 45360, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, moody and striking.  It''s when I see images of this quality I remember why I''ve got involved with DPC, to learn   :o)<br/>9</td>', 'Wonderful image, moody and striking.  It''s when I see images of this quality I remember why I''ve got involved with DPC, to learn   :o)9', '2006-01-22 03:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069854, 282580, 44611, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalism and b &amp; w treatment, but I suspect the literalists may wonder about the interpretation of the theme.  Also it''s not a conventional wedding band, which may affect it a bit.</td>', 'I like the minimalism and b & w treatment, but I suspect the literalists may wonder about the interpretation of the theme.  Also it''s not a conventional wedding band, which may affect it a bit.', '2006-01-22 03:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069855, 280861, 45360, '<td valign="top">Very moody, like this a lot.  I think the cropping is spot on.<br/>8</td>', 'Very moody, like this a lot.  I think the cropping is spot on.8', '2006-01-22 03:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069856, 281390, 44611, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon and rather central composition of this image make it rather snapshot-ish.  Focusing in more and making the the sign the major focus could have improved this enormously.</td>', 'The tilted horizon and rather central composition of this image make it rather snapshot-ish.  Focusing in more and making the the sign the major focus could have improved this enormously.', '2006-01-22 03:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069858, 282740, 44611, '<td valign="top">This may be an excellent shot, but as I am sure several people will point out, it is too small to be judged fairly.  For this unfortunately you will be marked down.  Remember next time to use the 640 pixels.</td>', 'This may be an excellent shot, but as I am sure several people will point out, it is too small to be judged fairly.  For this unfortunately you will be marked down.  Remember next time to use the 640 pixels.', '2006-01-22 03:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069859, 282262, 44611, '<td valign="top">Any one who can''t spell coffee, whatever your native language, strikes me as not having made a lot of effort with their entry.  I''m sorry if that sounds harsh, but it takes only a second to Google the correct spelling.  As to the image, unfortunately the focus is rather soft and the subject matter quite a chasm away from really being anything to do with signs.</td>', 'Any one who can''t spell coffee, whatever your native language, strikes me as not having made a lot of effort with their entry.  I''m sorry if that sounds harsh, but it takes only a second to Google the correct spelling.  As to the image, unfortunately the focus is rather soft and the subject matter quite a chasm away from really being anything to do with signs.', '2006-01-22 03:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069860, 283011, 45360, '<td valign="top">Lighting is just right and the expression of the model is subtle but resolute.  My only (tiny) niggle is the ring on her hand, I think this draws the eye away from the blade.<br/>Great image though.<br/>8</td>', 'Lighting is just right and the expression of the model is subtle but resolute.  My only (tiny) niggle is the ring on her hand, I think this draws the eye away from the blade.Great image though.8', '2006-01-22 03:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069862, 282686, 44611, '<td valign="top">Not sure what they are but they don''t indicate anything to me I''m afraid!  Interesting colours, but the soft focus doesn''t help interpret the image either.  Might make an intriguing abstract, but doesn''t meet this challenge I don''t think.</td>', 'Not sure what they are but they don''t indicate anything to me I''m afraid!  Interesting colours, but the soft focus doesn''t help interpret the image either.  Might make an intriguing abstract, but doesn''t meet this challenge I don''t think.', '2006-01-22 03:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069869, 282510, 44611, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ll accept that flags are indicators and as such are used as signs.  With this image though I can''t make out what it is the flag is trying to tell me.  At first I thought it was a golf green and hole, but no, that''s not right.  And I''m not sure about the horizon - maybe the land is on the rise away from you and that explains it, but maybe the horizon''s just wonky.  Hard to tell.</td>', 'Okay, I''ll accept that flags are indicators and as such are used as signs.  With this image though I can''t make out what it is the flag is trying to tell me.  At first I thought it was a golf green and hole, but no, that''s not right.  And I''m not sure about the horizon - maybe the land is on the rise away from you and that explains it, but maybe the horizon''s just wonky.  Hard to tell.', '2006-01-22 03:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069870, 282380, 44611, '<td valign="top">The yellow frame really does not enhance this image at all, it is simply distracting.</td>', 'The yellow frame really does not enhance this image at all, it is simply distracting.', '2006-01-22 03:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069871, 282769, 44611, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as a snapshot of the first sign you came across after reading the challenge theme.  There seems to be little consideration given to composition and structure, nor to appeal.  If you had focused in on the sign alone, using the contrasting redbrick wall you could have come up with a much more interesting image.</td>', 'This strikes me as a snapshot of the first sign you came across after reading the challenge theme.  There seems to be little consideration given to composition and structure, nor to appeal.  If you had focused in on the sign alone, using the contrasting redbrick wall you could have come up with a much more interesting image.', '2006-01-22 03:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069875, 282982, 44611, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it at all, sorry.  I don''t understand the link to the signs theme, or even where your title fits in.  Perhaps if the focus had been sharper things may have been clearer all round.</td>', 'I don''t get it at all, sorry.  I don''t understand the link to the signs theme, or even where your title fits in.  Perhaps if the focus had been sharper things may have been clearer all round.', '2006-01-22 03:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069876, 281064, 44611, '<td valign="top">This could have been vastly improved with sharper focusing and ensuring that your image was straight.</td>', 'This could have been vastly improved with sharper focusing and ensuring that your image was straight.', '2006-01-22 03:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069884, 282914, 44611, '<td valign="top">This image literally shows a sign, and that is just about all it does.  There is minimal appeal and I have to wonder why you took the shot at night?  Perhaps a very last minute snap simply to enter this challenge.  I think if this was the only subject matter I had, I would have tried to exclude the telegraph pole even perhaps focus far more on just one of the signs - they look as if they are wood, and therefore they probably have great textures.</td>', 'This image literally shows a sign, and that is just about all it does.  There is minimal appeal and I have to wonder why you took the shot at night?  Perhaps a very last minute snap simply to enter this challenge.  I think if this was the only subject matter I had, I would have tried to exclude the telegraph pole even perhaps focus far more on just one of the signs - they look as if they are wood, and therefore they probably have great textures.', '2006-01-22 04:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069885, 280252, 44611, '<td valign="top">Um, I really don''t know what to say.  I''ll ask some questions instead! Did you genuinely mean to enter this in the challenge?  What does ''Whoahm'' mean?  What is it?</td>', 'Um, I really don''t know what to say.  I''ll ask some questions instead! Did you genuinely mean to enter this in the challenge?  What does ''Whoahm'' mean?  What is it?', '2006-01-22 04:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2069915, 280025, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the second character in the third line is meant to be - ''wa'', perhaps. sa wa he ki ma, doesn''t make sense, though.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the second character in the third line is meant to be - ''wa'', perhaps. sa wa he ki ma, doesn''t make sense, though.', '2006-01-22 04:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
