(2078433, 280672, 34247, '<td valign="top">I''m tempted to add a couple of extra points for what the sign says *chuckle*<br/>I like the bw tonality, and the composition works very well on me. The contrast is wonderful, with nice dark tones on the left and lighter ones on the right, capped off by the hair on the primary subject. I think I will add those two extra points :)</td>', 'I''m tempted to add a couple of extra points for what the sign says *chuckle*I like the bw tonality, and the composition works very well on me. The contrast is wonderful, with nice dark tones on the left and lighter ones on the right, capped off by the hair on the primary subject. I think I will add those two extra points :)', '2006-01-24 15:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2078471, 279770, 34247, '<td valign="top">Real thought-provoking shot for me, and one of the more pleasing for me in this image. Nice contrast work, and the use of deep bokeh is effective. I''m almost wondering if there''d been a bit of burn work here, particularly on the right and left sides of the frame. Still...benefit of doubt and all that...8</td>', 'Real thought-provoking shot for me, and one of the more pleasing for me in this image. Nice contrast work, and the use of deep bokeh is effective. I''m almost wondering if there''d been a bit of burn work here, particularly on the right and left sides of the frame. Still...benefit of doubt and all that...8', '2006-01-24 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
