(2081972, 283010, 48471, '<td valign="top">Wow, I gave a 6 to graphicfunk! I guess I need to explain why: the colors, sharpness, composition and all the technical parts of the photo are perfect, so I knew that the guy/gal who took the picture knows what he''s doing. But, when I started looking for a story I got disappointed, because there wasn''t any. Yes, I see that there is a nice coffee and/or a taxi service at Cliente, in a very lovely neighbourhood (I love those blood red bricks and the texture), but, what''s the point? I didn''t get it. <br/>The technical merits made the mark above average, but only that, no more.<br/></td>', 'Wow, I gave a 6 to graphicfunk! I guess I need to explain why: the colors, sharpness, composition and all the technical parts of the photo are perfect, so I knew that the guy/gal who took the picture knows what he''s doing. But, when I started looking for a story I got disappointed, because there wasn''t any. Yes, I see that there is a nice coffee and/or a taxi service at Cliente, in a very lovely neighbourhood (I love those blood red bricks and the texture), but, what''s the point? I didn''t get it. The technical merits made the mark above average, but only that, no more.', '2006-01-25 09:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
