(2082402, 282935, 49094, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. When I pulled up to take the shot, I was disappointed to see the car parked there, but I decided to leave it in for a couple of reasons: 1. to show the size of the sign 2. because of the interesting reflection. I had a lot of trouble resizing this image without artifacts showing in the blue sky. Any suggestions?</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. When I pulled up to take the shot, I was disappointed to see the car parked there, but I decided to leave it in for a couple of reasons: 1. to show the size of the sign 2. because of the interesting reflection. I had a lot of trouble resizing this image without artifacts showing in the blue sky. Any suggestions?', '2006-01-25 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
