(2083353, 282779, 47415, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted and commented, I am thrilled to be in the top 10!!</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted and commented, I am thrilled to be in the top 10!!', '2006-01-25 14:53:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2083400, 282464, 43437, '<td valign="top">Well Im not sure HOW to make this better but I can tell you what I would work on.  I like the foggy look of the city and the water but the sky needs more contast, it looks like there are hazy clouds there that arent blown and if you could get rid of a little of the brightness there they would stand out.  The border of the sign is really bright.  I would somehow darken that to make it not so glaring, the agtual sign would stand out more without the competition.  I like the color scheme and the detail in the granite.</td>', 'Well Im not sure HOW to make this better but I can tell you what I would work on.  I like the foggy look of the city and the water but the sky needs more contast, it looks like there are hazy clouds there that arent blown and if you could get rid of a little of the brightness there they would stand out.  The border of the sign is really bright.  I would somehow darken that to make it not so glaring, the agtual sign would stand out more without the competition.  I like the color scheme and the detail in the granite.', '2006-01-25 14:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
