(2086778, 280341, 48471, '<td valign="top">I know now: I like the idea of using this angle, but I don''t like how it came out to be at this shot. It bothers me that the semicircular dome or whatever that thing in the rrof is, and a bit of the left window aren''t showing completely in the picture.</td>', 'I know now: I like the idea of using this angle, but I don''t like how it came out to be at this shot. It bothers me that the semicircular dome or whatever that thing in the rrof is, and a bit of the left window aren''t showing completely in the picture.', '2006-01-26 07:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2086896, 279917, 48471, '<td valign="top">I loved this image, and still love it! The tone fits perfectly and wonderfully sets the mood. Great choice of the angle: we''re faced with a tombstone, but not directly, so as not to force itself on us. The same is with Death: it''s there and you can''t avoid it, but it doesn''t force itself on us, so make the most of life. I try to read what''s written, but with some difficulties, while the jewel of the photo, the sentence "In the midst of life we are in death" is clear. So, what''s the point of reading further and finding out who lies there? The other grave in the back makes sure that one get''s it.<br/>But still, there are trees above everything, so hail to life. I guess...</td>', 'I loved this image, and still love it! The tone fits perfectly and wonderfully sets the mood. Great choice of the angle: we''re faced with a tombstone, but not directly, so as not to force itself on us. The same is with Death: it''s there and you can''t avoid it, but it doesn''t force itself on us, so make the most of life. I try to read what''s written, but with some difficulties, while the jewel of the photo, the sentence "In the midst of life we are in death" is clear. So, what''s the point of reading further and finding out who lies there? The other grave in the back makes sure that one get''s it.But still, there are trees above everything, so hail to life. I guess...', '2006-01-26 07:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2087185, 281906, 48471, '<td valign="top">The image is busy: so many things scattered all over the place, no order at all, everything is an interesting point by itself, but not as a whole. It''s a bit dark, but I guess more light would mean that the Corona neons would be distracting, so the trade was a very tough one.<br/>So, why 6, why above average? Because it celebrates life, it has these lovely colorful and star-shaped twinkles, it''s a refreshing take on the challenge, and it doesn''t have "sign..." in the title.<br/>If there would be a human face in the shot, it would be better, because what else is a beter celebration of life than a happy smiling human in a bar having a cold nice beer?<br/> <br/>Off I go now for a beer...</td>', 'The image is busy: so many things scattered all over the place, no order at all, everything is an interesting point by itself, but not as a whole. It''s a bit dark, but I guess more light would mean that the Corona neons would be distracting, so the trade was a very tough one.So, why 6, why above average? Because it celebrates life, it has these lovely colorful and star-shaped twinkles, it''s a refreshing take on the challenge, and it doesn''t have "sign..." in the title.If there would be a human face in the shot, it would be better, because what else is a beter celebration of life than a happy smiling human in a bar having a cold nice beer? Off I go now for a beer...', '2006-01-26 08:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
