(2100712, 282955, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>First off congrats on your second challenge.  It is really hard to put yourself out there with a piece to have other judge and critique you. I think the subject is excellent for the challenge.   I think the lighting itself is a little distracting in the shot.  The shadows are almost to dark and over powering.  Also I think the focus could have been a little stronger, even if it just one point that you focus on it would give the viewers an exact point for the focus.  The subjects overall placement is a little off it isn''t quite center and isn''t quite off to one side or another to fit the frame.  I would play with the shot itself a little, that''s usually what I try to look at.  I would try placing the light from below to see how that enhances the shot, I don''t think putting the light above would result in the effect you were looking for.  Also I would either tighten your crop or bring it out a little more.  Keep up the good work, and hopefully this helps you.</td>', '*Critique Club* First off congrats on your second challenge.  It is really hard to put yourself out there with a piece to have other judge and critique you. I think the subject is excellent for the challenge.   I think the lighting itself is a little distracting in the shot.  The shadows are almost to dark and over powering.  Also I think the focus could have been a little stronger, even if it just one point that you focus on it would give the viewers an exact point for the focus.  The subjects overall placement is a little off it isn''t quite center and isn''t quite off to one side or another to fit the frame.  I would play with the shot itself a little, that''s usually what I try to look at.  I would try placing the light from below to see how that enhances the shot, I don''t think putting the light above would result in the effect you were looking for.  Also I would either tighten your crop or bring it out a little more.  Keep up the good work, and hopefully this helps you.', '2006-01-30 02:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
