(2104564, 282973, 26930, '<td valign="top">[CRITIQUE CLUB]<br/>Well you have a decent picture here I believe the score 4.8-5 is pretty good for it becouse it lacks several things.<br/> <br/>1. I like the color. The sunlight realy makes the light on the shoes and you get a feel of autumn/winter sun.<br/>2. The Background is not good it rather makes the shoes blend into the backround becouse of all the branches so it kinda draws everything out of the picture.<br/>3. I believe that some photoshop work with some softening and so on could have made this picture a lot better.<br/> <br/>Hopefully this has helped you in your future work.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', '[CRITIQUE CLUB]Well you have a decent picture here I believe the score 4.8-5 is pretty good for it becouse it lacks several things. 1. I like the color. The sunlight realy makes the light on the shoes and you get a feel of autumn/winter sun.2. The Background is not good it rather makes the shoes blend into the backround becouse of all the branches so it kinda draws everything out of the picture.3. I believe that some photoshop work with some softening and so on could have made this picture a lot better. Hopefully this has helped you in your future work. Good luck', '2006-01-31 06:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
