(2387499, 281044, 28963, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion in your eyes and face ,also like that only your face is out of the shadow. However I find the lighting rather flat and harsh. This would have worked great as an even more low key image. You could have increased the contrast a bit with curves. Maybe it would have been better (I''m no expert. I personally like the it''s a little on the soft side, fits the mood.</td>', 'I love the emotion in your eyes and face ,also like that only your face is out of the shadow. However I find the lighting rather flat and harsh. This would have worked great as an even more low key image. You could have increased the contrast a bit with curves. Maybe it would have been better (I''m no expert. I personally like the it''s a little on the soft side, fits the mood.', '2006-05-06 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2435694, 281044, 41531, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, love the crop and the lighting!</td>', 'This is a great image, love the crop and the lighting!', '2006-05-19 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2490154, 281044, 52439, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot. I like the angle, the pose and the crop. Like your title says, it''s all in the eyes!<br/>And you have great eyes which are clearly highlighted by everything else being black.<br/> <br/>Nice setup, nice shot.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'This is a good shot. I like the angle, the pose and the crop. Like your title says, it''s all in the eyes!And you have great eyes which are clearly highlighted by everything else being black. Nice setup, nice shot.Well done.', '2006-06-06 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2491500, 282939, 37779, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how this could have scored below a 6. This photograph is amazing! What are people thinking?? Gosh, people here are so strange sometimes. You were robbed.</td>', 'I have no idea how this could have scored below a 6. This photograph is amazing! What are people thinking?? Gosh, people here are so strange sometimes. You were robbed.', '2006-06-06 20:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2598631, 282575, 44597, '<td valign="top">At first look I thought it was a Satanic type of thing with the pentagram and the smearing of something on the models bodies!</td>', 'At first look I thought it was a Satanic type of thing with the pentagram and the smearing of something on the models bodies!', '2006-07-07 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
