(3430467, 282891, 45672, '<td valign="top">This is actually a great photo.  I think you got hosed on the voting.  This one is quite good.</td>', 'This is actually a great photo.  I think you got hosed on the voting.  This one is quite good.', '2007-03-05 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3502988, 282939, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing picture. I have never been able to find a situation where I could place both the foreground and the moon in focus at the same time using a telephoto lens (in this case a 500mm), neither element would focus at the infinity setting; how did you manage to accomplish that?</td>', 'This is an amazing picture. I have never been able to find a situation where I could place both the foreground and the moon in focus at the same time using a telephoto lens (in this case a 500mm), neither element would focus at the infinity setting; how did you manage to accomplish that?', '2007-03-31 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3592393, 282803, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this a lot.  I think some additional processing could make the water look more dangerous and cold.</td>', 'I like the composition of this a lot.  I think some additional processing could make the water look more dangerous and cold.', '2007-04-29 14:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3866393, 281044, 12611, '<td valign="top">Strangely, you have a bit of a smirk on your face, but when you look at the eyes there is a seriousness. Great bunch of self portraits/</td>', 'Strangely, you have a bit of a smirk on your face, but when you look at the eyes there is a seriousness. Great bunch of self portraits/', '2007-07-04 08:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4114140, 280205, 42171, '<td valign="top">I agree with comments below... The road should be in the image too maybe? Looking at the shape of the image it looks to have been cropped, but possibly not to it''s advantage. I find it a little uninteresting.<br/> <br/>Technically, it seems well exposed.<br/> <br/>I can see it is listed under "Abstract", which I think describes this better than landscape.</td>', 'I agree with comments below... The road should be in the image too maybe? Looking at the shape of the image it looks to have been cropped, but possibly not to it''s advantage. I find it a little uninteresting. Technically, it seems well exposed. I can see it is listed under "Abstract", which I think describes this better than landscape.', '2007-09-25 09:19:29.000000', NULL, 0);
